<title>UK: BP appoints Prosser as non-executive director.</title>
<headline>BP appoints Prosser as non-executive director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum Co Plc said on Thursday that it has appointed Ian Prosser as a non-executive director to the company.</p>
<p>Prosser is chairman of brewer to Holiday Inn group Bass Plc and a non-executive director of Lloyds TSB Group Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
